meta {
  name: Space Import Space Meta
  type: http
  seq: 178
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/xrpc/com.atproto.space.importSpaceMeta
  body: binary
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/vnd.dasl.star
}

body:binary {
  @file: {{spaceMetaStarFilePath}}
}

vars:pre-request {
  spaceMetaStarFilePath: ./space-meta.star
}

docs {
  Import a space from the archive com.atproto.space.exportSpaceMeta produced on the old host,
  before the authority's own repo follows with space.importRepo. Creates the space (or
  replaces the policy of one this host already holds), then replaces its member list and
  writer set. Publishes nothing: the published policy and member records arrive with the
  authority's repo. The account must be deactivated and be the space's authority, with
  manage=create and manage=update grants.

  Errors: 400 InvalidSpaceMeta (malformed, an invalid policy, or policy state the policy does
  not define), 400 UnsupportedPolicy, 400 NotAuthorized, 403 when the account is active.
}
